  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: <span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Kordex offers a curated collection of home decor, wall art, and lifestyle products that help customers express their personal style and transform their spaces. From personalized signs and canvas prints to fashion accessories and home accents, we provide unique items that add character to any home.</span><br>• What makes us different:<span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">We offer a diverse range of personalized and ready-to-ship products with unique designs you won't find everywhere else. Our collection spans multiple categories including custom wall art, home decor, and fashion accessories, giving affiliates multiple product lines to promote to different audiences.</span><br>• How affiliates can earn: <span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Affiliates earn commission on every sale they generate through their unique referral link. Whether promoting our personalized signs, canvas wall art, home decor items, or fashion accessories, you'll receive a percentage of each purchase made by customers you refer.</span><br>• How to promote us: <span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Share your affiliate links on social media, blogs, home decor forums, or lifestyle content. Our products work great for content around home styling, gift guides, personalized decor ideas, and seasonal decorating. Product photos and promotional materials are available to help you create engaging content.</span><br>• Other information: <span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">We regularly update our product collection with new designs and seasonal items, giving affiliates fresh content to promote year-round. Our products appeal to homeowners, gift-givers, and anyone looking to personalize their space.</span></p></div></div>",
